OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'untapped potential' of Welsh
OL,4,Afolklore in gaming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Chinese role-playing game may be the
OL,7,Flast place you would expect to find a
OL,8,FWelsh character called Rhiannon, but
OL,9,Fthat is the case in Reverse: 1999.
OL,11,FThe 20th Century Time-Travel Strategic
OL,12,Fgame, created by Chinese developer
OL,13,FBluepoch, which said there were many
OL,14,Faspects of Welsh culture that
OL,15,F"resonated strongly with the world and
OL,16,Fstories" of the game.
OL,18,FVoice actor Rebecca Wang described
OL,19,Flearning aspects of the language, such
OL,20,Fas the amount of Ws, as a challenging
OL,21,Fbut a "fun process".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
