OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'untapped potential' of Welsh
OL,4,Afolklore in gaming
OL,5,
OL,6,FAaron Elias, who runs a gaming website,
OL,7,Fsaid Welsh history has "untapped
OL,8,Fpotential" in the gaming world, and
OL,9,Fthat more representation could raise
OL,10,Fthe profile of the country.
